        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/4dfc061c16d707ca2330ae822ea7b5bb.poster.avif?t=1783174721\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/4dfc061c16d707ca2330ae822ea7b5bb.webm?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/4dfc061c16d707ca2330ae822ea7b5bb.mp4?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dotu</strong> is a logic puzzle game that blends the number strategy of Sudoku with the grid-solving satisfaction of Picross. From peaceful beginnings to intricate challenges, each new Room offers new mechanics to keep your mind engaged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the right number of dots in each row and column to match their totals. Simple to learn, endlessly satisfying to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across 7 rooms, each one adds its own clever twist like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked Squares – Plan around spaces you can’t touch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linked Squares – One move can change them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Math-Based Totals – Sometimes you’ll need to think beyond simple counting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/01e33fa1209cb54aea40d3927903a85f.poster.avif?t=1783174721\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/01e33fa1209cb54aea40d3927903a85f.webm?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/01e33fa1209cb54aea40d3927903a85f.mp4?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ Levels</strong> <strong>Per Game Mode</strong> – Handcrafted challenges that grow in complexity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Rooms</strong> – Each with its own clever mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Art &amp; Relaxing Music</strong> – A calming, focused play experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong> – The perfect balance for puzzle lovers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay Hooked</strong> - New mechanics keep you guessing until the very end</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/5fbaee16b553403b44a1082d144f380d.poster.avif?t=1783174721\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/5fbaee16b553403b44a1082d144f380d.webm?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/5fbaee16b553403b44a1082d144f380d.mp4?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Game Modes to Suit Your Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the way you like with <strong>Relaxed Mode</strong>, where puzzles offer multiple solutions for a more laid-back experience, or challenge yourself in <strong>Focused Mode</strong>, where each puzzle has a single solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're after a casual puzzle fix or a challenge Dotu has you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/d2381b1f14339f66817b984a7621ce44.poster.avif?t=1783174721\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/d2381b1f14339f66817b984a7621ce44.webm?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/d2381b1f14339f66817b984a7621ce44.mp4?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy games that make you think, plan, and smile when everything clicks, you’ll feel right at home in Dotu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for a quick mental break or sink hours into cracking every puzzle. Dotu is your next puzzle obsession.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/4dfc061c16d707ca2330ae822ea7b5bb.poster.avif?t=1783174721\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/4dfc061c16d707ca2330ae822ea7b5bb.webm?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/4dfc061c16d707ca2330ae822ea7b5bb.mp4?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dotu</strong> is a logic puzzle game that blends the number strategy of Sudoku with the grid-solving satisfaction of Picross. From peaceful beginnings to intricate challenges, each new Room offers new mechanics to keep your mind engaged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the right number of dots in each row and column to match their totals. Simple to learn, endlessly satisfying to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across 7 rooms, each one adds its own clever twist like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked Squares – Plan around spaces you can’t touch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linked Squares – One move can change them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Math-Based Totals – Sometimes you’ll need to think beyond simple counting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/01e33fa1209cb54aea40d3927903a85f.poster.avif?t=1783174721\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/01e33fa1209cb54aea40d3927903a85f.webm?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/01e33fa1209cb54aea40d3927903a85f.mp4?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ Levels</strong> <strong>Per Game Mode</strong> – Handcrafted challenges that grow in complexity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Rooms</strong> – Each with its own clever mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Art &amp; Relaxing Music</strong> – A calming, focused play experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong> – The perfect balance for puzzle lovers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay Hooked</strong> - New mechanics keep you guessing until the very end</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/5fbaee16b553403b44a1082d144f380d.poster.avif?t=1783174721\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/5fbaee16b553403b44a1082d144f380d.webm?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/5fbaee16b553403b44a1082d144f380d.mp4?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Game Modes to Suit Your Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the way you like with <strong>Relaxed Mode</strong>, where puzzles offer multiple solutions for a more laid-back experience, or challenge yourself in <strong>Focused Mode</strong>, where each puzzle has a single solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're after a casual puzzle fix or a challenge Dotu has you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/d2381b1f14339f66817b984a7621ce44.poster.avif?t=1783174721\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/d2381b1f14339f66817b984a7621ce44.webm?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456230/extras/d2381b1f14339f66817b984a7621ce44.mp4?t=1783174721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy games that make you think, plan, and smile when everything clicks, you’ll feel right at home in Dotu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for a quick mental break or sink hours into cracking every puzzle. Dotu is your next puzzle obsession.</p>",
